*.img
# claude: anchored to their real build locations, and no longer bare
# words - a bare "kernel"/"mkfs" pattern also matches a DIRECTORY of that
# name, which the Phase 0 kernel/ and tools/ layout needs to exist, and
# the build wrote a FILE named "kernel" at the fork root, which cannot
# coexist with a directory of the same name at all. Same shape as
# forks/riscv64/.gitignore's own "/kernel/kernel", "/tools/mkfs".
/initcode
/initcode.out
/kernel/kernel
/tools/mkfs
